'''Snow Suit''' is an {{Epic}} [[Armor]] set obtainable through opening [[Gift]]s. Each piece grants a {{Green|5%}} bonus gift chance on every present earned from the [[Defend Jerry's Workshop]] event during the [[Season of Jerry]], adding up to a {{Green|20%}} bonus when wearing the full set (including the equipment pieces).

