=== Salvaging ===
'''Snow Suit Armor''' can be salvaged for {{Item|Ice Essence|amount=10}} per piece. Despite technically being part of the '''Snow Suit Armor''' tiered bonus, Snow Suit equipment cannot be salvaged.

== Skins ==
{{Item Skins|Snow Suit Helmet}}

==Tips == 
*This armor setup is very useful during the [[Defend Jerry's Workshop]] event due to the [[Snowball]] bonus, allowing you to use abilities that aid you in the fight like the {{Item|Aspect of the End}}'s ability, [[Power Orbs]], and {{Item|Wand of Healing}}.

==Trivia== 
*The armor set's {{AN|Cold Thumb}} ability also works with {{Item|Frosty the Snow Blaster}}.
*There was an original texture for the helmet that looks like the helmet for {{Item|Speedster Armor}}.
*The Snow Suit Armor is one of 6 armor pieces which have the hex color code of {{Color Display|#FFFFFF}}. The others are {{Item|Heavy Helmet}}, {{Item|Heavy Boots}}, {{Item|Helmet of the Pack}}, {{Item|Kelly's T-Shirt}} and {{Item|Leggings of the Coven}} (white variant).

